    do not necessarily correspond to the actual value that may be realized by the named executive officer. For a summary of the assumptions
    made in the valuation of the awards, please see Note 19 to our financial statements as of and for the period ended December 31, 2024
    included in the 2024 Annual Report.</span></td></tr>
