    WITHHOLD ALL</span></td>
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 33%; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#9744;
    FOR ALL EXCEPT:</span></td></tr>
  </table>
<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">2.
To ratify the appointment of Haynie &amp; Company as the Company&#8217;s independent registered public accounting firm for the year
ending December 31, 2026.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse">
  <tr style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; vertical-align: top">
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 33%; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#9744;
    FOR</span></td>
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 34%; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#9744;
    AGAINST</span></td>
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 33%; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#9744;
    ABSTAIN</span></td></tr>
  </table>
<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">3.
To approve the 2026 Equity Incentive Plan.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse">
  <tr style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; vertical-align: top">
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 33%; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#9744;
    FOR</span></td>
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 34%; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#9744;
    AGAINST</span></td>
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 33%; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#9744;
    ABSTAIN</span></td></tr>
  </table>
<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 1in; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">4.
To approve the redomestication of the Company&#8217;s jurisdiction of incorporation from Delaware to Nevada (the &#8220;Redomestication&#8221;),
including the terms, conditions and effect of such Redomestication.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse">
  <tr style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; vertical-align: top">
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 33%; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#9744;
    FOR</span></td>
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 34%; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#9744;
    AGAINST</span></td>
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 33%; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#9744;
    ABSTAIN</span></td></tr>
  </table>
<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: left"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify; background-color: white"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">5.
To approve the increase in the Company&#8217;s authorized shares of Class A common stock from 650,000,000 shares to ____________ shares
in connection with the Redomestication.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify; background-color: white">&#160;</p>

<table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse">
  <tr style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; vertical-align: top">
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 33%; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#9744;
    FOR</span></td>
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 34%; text-align: center">&#9744; <span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">AGAINST</span></td>
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 33%; text-align: center">&#9744; <span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">ABSTAIN</span></td></tr>
  </table>
<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify; background-color: white"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;6.
To approve, for purposes of complying with Nasdaq Listing Rule 5635(d), the issuance of more than 20% of the Company&#8217;s issued and
outstanding common stock pursuant to the Company&#8217;s equity purchase facility agreement dated May 14, 2025 with SZOP Opportunities
I LLC.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify; background-color: white">&#160;</p>

<table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse">
  <tr style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; vertical-align: top">
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 33%; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#9744;
    FOR</span></td>
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 34%; text-align: center">&#9744; <span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">AGAINST</span></td>
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 33%; text-align: center">&#9744; <span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">ABSTAIN</span></td></tr>
  </table>
<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify; background-color: white">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify; background-color: white"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">7.
To approve an adjournment of the Annual Meeting, if necessary, to solicit additional proxies if there are not sufficient votes in favor
of Proposals 2-6.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify; background-color: white">&#160;</p>

<table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse">
  <tr style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; vertical-align: top">
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 33%; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#9744;
    FOR</span></td>
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 34%; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#9744;
    AGAINST</span></td>
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 33%; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#9744;
    ABSTAIN</span></td></tr>
  </table>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>Note</b>
: In his discretion, the Proxy is authorized to vote upon such other business as may properly come before the meeting.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="border-bottom: black 1pt solid; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Please
sign exactly as your name(s) appear(s) hereon. When signing as attorney, executor, administrator, or other fiduciary, please give full
title as such. Joint owners should each sign personally. All holders must sign. If a corporation or partnership, please sign in full
corporate or partnership name by authorized officer.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

